Error [jet.MemoryOperationOutsideUnsafe]: `#Import(c)` of the Jet runtime symbol `jet_rt_process_exit` can only sit inside `#Unsafe`.
  --> tests/ui/runtime_import_needs_unsafe/run.jet:2:1
    |
  2 | raw_exit: fn(code: I64) = "jet_rt_process_exit"
    | ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The runtime's C exports are its internals, not a checked API, so reaching one directly needs an audited region.
 Fix: Gate the declaration with `#[Import(c), Unsafe("why this is safe")]`, or call the Core function that wraps it.
